            "start": 1294,
            "end": 1379,
            "quote": "Host 侧要能真正异步拷贝通常需要 pinned memory（`aclrtMallocHost` 或 `ACL_MEM_MALLOC_HUGE_FIRST` 之类）。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
